e time and as  such they don't they never release which  tauf but they never really fully  productive but if you know exactly how  much you've got to do and if you train  yourself over time to complete that  amount suddenly you've got the  flexibility to decide how you want to  design your day now you can start taking  full advantage of what it means to work  from home and if you're really  productive you can have a whole day off  as a result or you can work on something  else another side project and that's how  I built the Pioneer rave all these years  was by writing a certain amount every  day becoming productive enough to finish  it on time or early so that I could work  on the buyer near and these days I do my  work in four days a week so that I have  one day a week to work on the bian ear  and make these videos let's face it in  the office people wasted loads of time  you might go and speak to people around  the water cooler you probably have loads  of meetings that are completely  unhelpful this is called communication  overhead or you might just go and have a  long cigarette if you do that or have a  long dump in the toilet whatever the  case you probably waste a lot of time in  the office and that's because you have  to be there set amount of time when you  work from home you can remove all that  and you can stick it all on the end of  your day and just have a big chunk of  enjoyment and relaxation the problem is  like I say is lots of us don't do that  we end up half working throughout the  day working slowly dragging our heels  just because we're so used to the idea  that we work from nine till five or nine  till six but it doesn't have to be that  way now with a set target you can sit  down at 9:00 a.m. and no that's all  you've got to finish and it makes it  much easier if you just stay motivated  and finish it but one more thing I will  say is that this does take time and  effort just like anything else this is a  skill I started off working only able 